WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.169
Before you choose The Watcher, this is how its cycle works.

00:00:05.169 --> 00:00:11.613
This video previews the membership; watching it does not start a trial, complete checkout or grant access.

00:00:11.613 --> 00:00:15.024
Review the current terms on Whop before you subscribe.

00:00:15.024 --> 00:00:23.363
The monthly choice begins with seven days free and then costs twenty-eight dollars every twenty-eight days, unless you cancel under Whop's terms.

00:00:23.363 --> 00:00:25.637
An annual choice is listed separately.

00:00:25.637 --> 00:00:33.218
Each cycle follows one being through four weekly chapters, making room for the image and its story to unfold slowly.

00:00:33.218 --> 00:00:38.524
In the first week, the Realm brings you face to face with that being.

00:00:38.524 --> 00:00:41.935
The point is not to watch everything at once.

00:00:41.935 --> 00:00:48.000
It is to return to one vision, and to see more when the next part arrives.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:54.030
Week two is the Process.

00:00:54.030 --> 00:01:00.526
Here the focus moves behind the finished image, toward the decisions and craft that shaped it.

00:01:00.526 --> 00:01:04.180
In week three, the Records open up its story.

00:01:04.180 --> 00:01:09.459
Names, context and details give the vision a place in a wider mythology.

00:01:09.459 --> 00:01:17.985
Week four brings the Session, the time set aside for a live gathering, questions and the next turn of the cycle.

00:01:17.985 --> 00:01:24.887
Check the actual schedule and availability in Whop rather than assuming a browser page is a ticket.

00:01:24.887 --> 00:01:32.195
The film then moves through the archive: images, files and material intended to make the work worth revisiting.

00:01:32.195 --> 00:01:38.286
The exact items you can open depend on the membership and your verified Whop access.

00:01:38.286 --> 00:01:46.000
Think of this as a look at the room, not as confirmation that your account already owns its contents.

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:55.568
The community spaces make room to talk about the work and to return between chapters.

00:01:55.568 --> 00:02:01.508
The Codex, if offered, is a separate product; it is not automatically included in The Watcher.

00:02:01.508 --> 00:02:07.076
Likewise, other future books or editions should not be assumed to come with this membership.

00:02:07.076 --> 00:02:12.273
You can compare the monthly trial with the separate annual option before you decide.

00:02:12.273 --> 00:02:17.098
The monthly trial is seven days free, then twenty-eight dollars every twenty-eight days.

00:02:17.098 --> 00:02:24.152
The seven-night return window described on this site begins after the first payment, not when the free trial begins.

00:02:24.152 --> 00:02:30.462
For the live price, eligibility, renewal terms and your actual entitlement, rely on Whop and its receipt.

00:02:30.462 --> 00:02:35.659
If you are ready, use the choice below this film to continue to Whop.

00:02:35.659 --> 00:02:39.000
You can leave this preview without beginning a trial.
